We've added several features from Volume 2!  

A new radar system!  Clickable targets. Screens are resizable and movable.  Flight path display.  Multi-colored targets.

Added a Career Stats page;
Fixed issue with wrong control panel opening;
Fixed issue with Boston 27 departures not holding clear of 33L;
Reduced likelihood of aircraft “circling” on approach;
Added thrust reverse sound;
Removed aircraft tag box for less clutter;
Fixed overly loud “game over” sound during replays.

